  "notes": "USAGE PATTERNS:\n- {浮|う}き{浮|う}きする (to feel excited/cheerful)\n- {浮|う}き{浮|う}きした{気分|きぶん} (a cheerful mood)\n- {浮|う}き{浮|う}き{気分|きぶん} (excited mood)\n\nONOMATOPOEIA NOTES:\n- This is a giongo/gitaigo ({擬態語|ぎたいご}) that expresses a light, buoyant emotional state.\n- Related to the verb {浮|う}く (to float), suggesting a feeling of lightness.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- わくわく (excited, thrilled)\n- そわそわ (restless, fidgety)",
